WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.425
So, four decisions.

2
00:00:01.425 --> 00:00:04.587
Name an agency-level owner
of the Zero Trust posture,

3
00:00:04.587 --> 00:00:07.675
separate from every cloud
provider relationship.

4
00:00:07.675 --> 00:00:11.405
Reconcile the network, every
cloud and the virtualization

5
00:00:11.405 --> 00:00:15.363
estate to one authoritative record
before scoring any of them.

6
00:00:15.363 --> 00:00:21.767
Close the BOD 25-01 mandatory
findings before measuring maturity,

7
00:00:21.767 --> 00:00:25.163
with Google Workspace
due December 1, 2026.

8
00:00:25.163 --> 00:00:29.057
And move every exception into
the versioned configuration file,

9
00:00:29.057 --> 00:00:33.601
with an expiration, and route each
standing one to the authorizing official.

10
00:00:33.601 --> 00:00:35.800
The next step needs no procurement.

11
00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:39.881
Find out, pillar by pillar, which
evidence can be re-run without

12
00:00:39.881 --> 00:00:43.962
the operator's help, because
every no is the adoption boundary.

13
00:00:43.962 --> 00:00:48.412
And put the assessment hosts and
accounts in the Agency Logging Plan now.

14
00:00:48.412 --> 00:00:50.089
Unify first, assess second,

15
00:00:50.089 --> 00:00:54.051
and let named people make the
decisions the evidence supports.

16
00:00:54.051 --> 00:00:57.662
Book 11 has the detail,
every claim footnoted.

17
00:00:57.662 --> 00:00:58.490
Thank you.
